{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/b891c62170a114262fd04a005bddfe90.avif?t=1772082104\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras_big/b891c62170a114262fd04a005bddfe90.avif?t=1772082104 width=800 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>'Deadly Trick' is a anime-style social deduction game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your ultimate goal is to complete the class activities and survive the deadly 'Special Class' at Lastope School.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/3a641da5f009081c183c9d99ceeeca2d.poster.avif?t=1772082104\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/3a641da5f009081c183c9d99ceeeca2d.webm?t=1772082104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/3a641da5f009081c183c9d99ceeeca2d.mp4?t=1772082104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather your friends and play together!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Trick is designed for 5 to 8 players.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/f9295e52f3317ea7fcd1577ca58bb81e.poster.avif?t=1772082104\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/f9295e52f3317ea7fcd1577ca58bb81e.webm?t=1772082104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/f9295e52f3317ea7fcd1577ca58bb81e.mp4?t=1772082104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Deadly Trick, players choose their own roles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depending on your choice, you can become a kind-hearted &quot;White&quot; or a ruthless &quot;Shadow&quot;!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/131c209e25358d04a7ef9edadad3f1c6.poster.avif?t=1772082104\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/131c209e25358d04a7ef9edadad3f1c6.webm?t=1772082104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/131c209e25358d04a7ef9edadad3f1c6.mp4?t=1772082104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you choose to be the White,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete the class activities and escape from the school! </strong> <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/9f4d9550da931c17fbde7b312a42f375.poster.avif?t=1772082104\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/9f4d9550da931c17fbde7b312a42f375.webm?t=1772082104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/9f4d9550da931c17fbde7b312a42f375.mp4?t=1772082104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you decide to become the Shadow...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secretly eliminate the other participants!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/03c40a2567b881305d465a9c12e9c0cf.poster.avif?t=1772082104\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/03c40a2567b881305d465a9c12e9c0cf.webm?t=1772082104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/03c40a2567b881305d465a9c12e9c0cf.mp4?t=1772082104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When an incident occurs, an investigation begins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players gather clues at the crime scene to figure out who the Shadow is.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>During the &quot;Class Trial&quot; that follows the investigation, you must identify the culprit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you fail to pinpoint the culprit during the trial...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/2d6da333c7415a9fa5aad4b68245153c.poster.avif?t=1772082104\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/2d6da333c7415a9fa5aad4b68245153c.webm?t=1772082104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/2d6da333c7415a9fa5aad4b68245153c.mp4?t=1772082104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everyone except the Shadow will be immediately executed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That\u2019s why it\u2019s crucial to discuss thoroughly and deduce who the Black really is!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/5af43513c3eb7cdc691bee83bbe781dd.poster.avif?t=1772082104\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/5af43513c3eb7cdc691bee83bbe781dd.webm?t=1772082104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/5af43513c3eb7cdc691bee83bbe781dd.mp4?t=1772082104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/3acb7bdad61bb3a8f6a4e0c8b13c98fb.poster.avif?t=1772082104\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/3acb7bdad61bb3a8f6a4e0c8b13c98fb.webm?t=1772082104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088400/extras/3acb7bdad61bb3a8f6a4e0c8b13c98fb.mp4?t=1772082104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Organize the clues you\u2019ve gathered into &quot;statements,&quot;</strong>